Data notice

The files in data/ contain commit messages collected from the public Git history
of the open-source repositories listed in configs/repos.yaml. Every one of these
repositories is licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License 2.0, and the
commit messages remain subject to the license of the repository they come from.
Each row keeps the repository name and the commit SHA so it can be traced back to
its source. Author names and e-mail addresses were not collected.
